entries[90843] = { ["name"] = "Headdress of the First Shaman", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 15\nThe origin of shamanism among the orcs remains a mystery. As far back as orcish history has been recorded, shaman have been mentioned. This simple headdress seems ancient beyond time. Its creator and original wearer have been lost to history.\nHeaddress of the First Shaman\nBinds to account\nHead Mail\n720 Armor\n+39 Agility\n+21 Stamina\n+ 22 Hit\n+ 22 Critical Strike\n\nRed Socket\nBlue Socket\nYellow Socket\nSocket Bonus: + 6 Stamina\n\nDurability 100 / 100\n61\nUse: Allows you to see far into the distance. (1 Min Cooldown)" }
